<title>USA: Security First Network Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Security First Network Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								March 31,</p>
<p>					    1997			 1996</p>
<p>Net interest income		   888			    237</p>
<p>Gain on sale of branch office    1,512			   ---</p>
<p>Net loss			    $(5,868)		     $ (683)</p>
<p>Net loss per common share     $ (0.71)		     $(0.28)</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p> shares outstanding	    8,276,415		   2,400,000</p>
<p>Common shares outstanding at</p>
<p>     end of period	     8,426,425		   2,400,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net loss for the first quarter of 1997 includes a $1.5 million gain, or $0.18 per share, on the sale of Pineville, Ky., banking operation which was sold in March 1997.  </p>
<p>Net income for the first quarter of 1997 also included approximately $250,000 in one time costs associated with the branch sale, approximately $280,000 in one-time charges associated with the hiring and relocation of staff and other expenses.</p>
